What this licence covers, and what it does not

* It covers the original work in this repository: the Darklands+ port (port/),
  the tools, the format readers, the new encounters and mods, and the
  documentation.
* It does NOT cover Darklands itself. The reconstructed C under src/ is derived
  from MicroProse's 1992 program and remains subject to whatever rights the
  owners of Darklands hold; nothing here grants rights to the game, its
  artwork, music, text or data. No game files are included: you need your own
  copy of Darklands 483.07.
* Third-party components keep their own licences (Dear ImGui, Nuked OPL3,
  libmt32emu, stb, the fonts, SDL2, TinyCC, Python, capstone); see
  port/third_party/ and the licenses folder of a release.
